'''A Gift of Cats''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 4.5 Update|Version 4.5]] and has a chance to be unlocked when beating any stage in [[Santa Claws at Work!#Night 1: Santa Claws at Work|Night 1: Santa Claws at Work]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 244
|rarity = RR
|name1 = A Gift of Cats
|name2 = Cat's Gift
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Cat's Gift''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Although this unit has a relatively low chance of freeze (30%), its nimble movement speed allows it to reach enemies quickly, and slip into blindspots easily (most notable for [[Cruel Angel Clionel]]). However, in many other situations, [[Juliet Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Juliet the Maiko]] or [[Talents|talented]] [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]] are better due to their stackability, Area Attacks, and longer range.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller & Rusher}}

